  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Shadow Killer — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level, you have mastered your technique allowing you to expand your domain. Within your domain, the shadows of all creatures are always visible to you and stretch towards you so they are always at your feet and able to be targeted. At initiative 20, three creatures of your choice suffer the full effect of <em>Shadow Strike</em>.</p>",
